    },
    {
      "displayText": "野生特區太棒啦！\n我現在是天天捕捉鯉魚王呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CE751F72795340592A68D25566FF01000A621173FE5728662F59295929635563499BC99B5A738B54623002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喏，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看！\n我捉到了特大號的鯉魚王喔！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我從「查看能力」確認過牠是XL尺寸，\n說牠是特大號的準沒錯！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "558FFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770BFF01000A6211634952304E8672795927865F76849BC99B5A738B5594FF0100100001BE01000A62115F9E300C67E5770B80FD529B300D78BA8A8D904E7260662F0058004C5C3A5BF8FF0C000A8AAA7260662F72795927865F76846E966C92932FFF01FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "塊頭特別大，\n跳躍起來特別高！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "584A982D727952255927FF0C000A8DF38E8D8D774F86727952259AD8FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～要比我的鯉魚王\n還要更大隻的鯉魚王，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n應該是絕對不存在的啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5E89816BD4621176849BC99B5A738B000A9084898166F4592796BB76849BC99B5A738BFF0C00100001BE00000A61C98A72662F7D555C0D4E0D5B58572876845566FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能捉到比XL尺寸還要更大的鯉魚王，\n可要讓我大開眼界一下啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD634952306BD40058004C5C3A5BF89084898166F4592776849BC99B5A738BFF0C000A53EF89818B9362115927958B773C754C4E004E0B554AFF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這只是個傳聞，但……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n聽說在2號野生特區會出現\n特大尺寸的鯉魚王喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901953EA662F500B50B3805EFF0C4F462026202600100001BE01000A807D8AAA57280032865F91CE751F72795340670351FA73FE000A727959275C3A5BF876849BC99B5A738B55943002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能捉到比我的鯉魚王還要更大的\n鯉魚王，就帶來給我看看吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD634952306BD4621176849BC99B5A738B9084898166F459277684000A9BC99B5A738BFF0C5C315E364F867D666211770B770B5427FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這世上不可能會有比我的鯉魚王\n還要更大的鯉魚王的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E164E0A4E0D53EF80FD670367096BD4621176849BC99B5A738B000A9084898166F4592776849BC99B5A738B76843002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "跟我的鯉魚王比起來，\n這尺寸真是小巫見大巫呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8DDF621176849BC99B5A738B6BD48D774F86FF0C000A90195C3A5BF8771F662F5C0F5DEB898B59275DEB5462FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然是不可能超越吧！\n哈！哈！哈！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C7136662F4E0D53EF80FD8D858D8A5427FF01000A54C8FF0154C8FF0154C8FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喲喲！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這隻鯉魚王……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B255B2FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3901996BB9BC99B5A738B20262026001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呼……就差一點，\n但還是我的鯉魚王贏啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547C202620265C315DEE4E009EDEFF0C000A4F469084662F621176849BC99B5A738B8D0F55663002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這……這怎麼回事！？\n那是什麼尺寸！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019202620269019600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF01FF1F000A90A3662F4EC09EBC5C3A5BF8FF01FF1F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啥？頭……目？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5565FF1F982D2026202676EEFF1F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "頭目是什麼東西！犯規啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "982D76EE662F4EC09EBC6771897FFF0172AF898F554AFF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我們的對決還沒結束！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E146211501176845C0D6C7A90846C927D50675FFF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鯉魚王的真髓在於牠的招式，躍起！\n我們用躍起分高下吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9BC99B5A738B7684771F9AD3572865BC7260768462DB5F0FFF0C8E8D8D77FF01000A6211501175288E8D8D7752069AD84E0B5427FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "預備～開始！跳躍吧！\n我的鯉魚王XL尺寸！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98105099FF5E958B59CBFF018DF38E8D5427FF01000A621176849BC99B5A738B0058004C5C3A5BF8FF01FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這……這也太高了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90192026202690194E5F592A9AD84E8620262026001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "輸了……\n我徹底被打敗了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F384E8620262026000A62115FB95E9588AB625365574E863002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到頭目不只是塊頭大，\n還能跳躍得這麼高……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D5230982D76EE4E0D53EA662F584A982D5927FF0C000A908480FD8DF38E8D5F9790199EBC9AD820262026001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "頭目是吧……\n這下我也有了新的目標啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
